00:06:21.141 --> 00:06:27.626
A 7.6 kilowatt hour reduction that preserves range while lowering mass is a cost story,

00:06:27.986 --> 00:06:29.366
not just a range story.

00:06:29.886 --> 00:06:34.626
Efficiency, cost, and regulatory constraints interact tightly in robotaxi design.

00:06:35.286 --> 00:06:39.386
The current CyberCab pack is built with dry cathode 4680 cells.

00:06:40.006 --> 00:06:43.326
Measured efficiency is 6.18 miles per kilowatt hour.

00:06:43.906 --> 00:06:48.766
Efficiency gains now allow a 16% smaller pack that keeps range nearly intact.

00:06:48.766 --> 00:06:55.826
weight falls below 3,000 pounds from the present 3,113 pounds. A lighter vehicle lowers

00:06:55.826 --> 00:07:01.386
both material cost and energy consumption. The battery itself represents roughly 20%

00:07:01.386 --> 00:07:07.466
of total manufacturing cost, so the change trims overall vehicle expense by more than 3%.

00:07:07.466 --> 00:07:13.106
That margin improvement matters because Tesla plans to operate its own fleet set ride prices.

00:07:13.106 --> 00:07:18.186
Every percentage point saved on the vehicle directly affects operating margins at scale.

00:07:18.686 --> 00:07:24.126
The same logic opens the door to cheaper lithium iron phosphate or LFP cells in future

00:07:24.126 --> 00:07:29.006
modules since the smaller pack leaves headroom for chemistry swaps without redesigning

00:07:29.006 --> 00:07:30.066
the entire structure.

00:07:30.666 --> 00:07:35.226
Reaction injection molding mixes pigment into the plastic body panels during forming,

00:07:35.526 --> 00:07:39.666
so a second color needs only a second mold set rather than a full paint line.

00:07:39.666 --> 00:07:45.446
Two colors reduce visual monotony for riders and make individual vehicles easier to identify

00:07:45.446 --> 00:07:49.086
it pick up, which supports higher utilization in a shared fleet.

00:07:49.686 --> 00:07:54.526
Further gains come from incremental systems work rather than radical redesign, keeping

00:07:54.526 --> 00:07:58.926
engineering resources on the larger factory transition away from cyber truck lines.

00:07:59.646 --> 00:08:04.346
Vertical integration in cells, pack design, and software matters more than any single

00:08:04.346 --> 00:08:09.746
specification. Rivals that buy cells and outsource software face harder trade-offs when

00:08:09.746 --> 00:08:15.386
they attempt the same downsizing. Lower vehicle cost improves margins, lighter weight improves

00:08:15.386 --> 00:08:21.026
efficiency, and both feed back into pricing power for the Robotaxi service. That closed

00:08:21.026 --> 00:08:26.781
loop is what turns a modest battery change into a structural edge. Before we go, the next

